{"id":"workbook-137","book":"workbook","page":137,"title":"Câu 36–40.","blocks":[{"id":"workbook-137-block-1","title":"Câu 36–40.","kind":"exercise","items":[{"id":"workbook-137-2","text":"第36—40题","zh":"第36–40题","pinyin":"dì 3 6 · 4 0 tí","vi":"Câu 36–40.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99208,"reviewed":true,"role":"instruction"},{"id":"workbook-137-4","text":"例如：请问现在几点了？","zh":"例如：请问现在几点了？","pinyin":"lì rú： qǐng wèn xiàn zài jǐ diǎn le？","vi":"Ví dụ: Xin hỏi, bây giờ là mấy giờ?","translation":"edited","confidence":0.97341,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-6","text":"★说话人想知道什么?","zh":"说话人想知道什么？","pinyin":"shuō huà rén xiǎng zhī dào shén me？","vi":"Người nói muốn biết điều gì?","translation":"edited","confidence":0.96387,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-10","text":"A时间","zh":"时间","pinyin":"shíjiān","vi":"Thời gian","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99994,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-11","text":"B名字","zh":"名字","pinyin":"míngzi","vi":"Tên gọi","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99972,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-12","text":"C房间号","zh":"房间号","pinyin":"fáng jiān hào","vi":"Số phòng.","translation":"edited","confidence":0.9995,"label":"C","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-16","text":"下雨了，我们坐出租车回家吧。","zh":"下雨了，我们坐出租车回家吧。","pinyin":"xià yǔ le， wǒ men zuò chū zū chē huí jiā ba。","vi":"Trời mưa rồi; chúng ta đi taxi về nhà nhé.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99961,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-18","text":"★说话人想怎么回家?","zh":"说话人想怎么回家？","pinyin":"shuō huà rén xiǎng zěn me huí jiā？","vi":"Người nói muốn về nhà bằng cách nào?","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.96386,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-22","text":"A开车","zh":"开车","pinyin":"kāi chē","vi":"Lái xe","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99876,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-23","text":"B坐飞机","zh":"坐飞机","pinyin":"zuò fēi jī","vi":"Đi máy bay.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99971,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-24","text":"C坐出租车","zh":"坐出租车","pinyin":"zuò chū zū chē","vi":"Đi taxi.","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99913,"label":"C","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-28","text":"我儿子今年16岁了，正在","zh":"我儿子今年16岁了，正在","pinyin":"wǒ ér zi jīn nián 1 6 suì le， zhèng zài","vi":"Con trai tôi năm nay mười sáu tuổi, đang …","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99942,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-29","text":"上","zh":"上","pinyin":"shàng","vi":"Trên, lên","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99997,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-30","text":"中学。","zh":"中学。","pinyin":"zhōng xué。","vi":"Trường trung học","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99991,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-32","text":"★说话人的儿子是：","zh":"说话人的儿子是：","pinyin":"shuō huà rén de ér zi shì：","vi":"Con trai của người nói là: …","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99393,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-36","text":"A小学生","zh":"小学生","pinyin":"xiǎo xué sheng","vi":"Học sinh tiểu học","translation":"edited","confidence":0.9999,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-37","text":"B中学生","zh":"中学生","pinyin":"zhōng xué sheng","vi":"Học sinh trung học","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99977,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-38","text":"C大学生","zh":"大学生","pinyin":"dà xué sheng","vi":"Sinh viên đại học","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99694,"label":"C","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-40","text":"38．小猫和小狗都在房间外睡觉呢。","zh":"38小猫和小狗都在房间外睡觉呢小狗在：","pinyin":"3 8 xiǎo māo hé xiǎo gǒu dōu zài fáng jiān wài shuì jiào ne xiǎo gǒu zài：","vi":"Mèo con và chó con đều đang ngủ ở bên ngoài phòng. Chó con ở: …","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.97941,"label":"38","role":"example","mergedIds":["workbook-137-42"]},{"id":"workbook-137-46","text":"A桌子下","zh":"桌子下","pinyin":"zhuō zi xià","vi":"Dưới bàn.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99981,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-47","text":"B房间里","zh":"房间里","pinyin":"fáng jiān lǐ","vi":"Trong phòng.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99987,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-48","text":"C房间外","zh":"房间外","pinyin":"fáng jiān wài","vi":"Bên ngoài phòng.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99919,"label":"C","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-51","text":"我同学在这个学校工作很多年了，你有问题可以问他。","zh":"我同学在这个学校工作很多年了，你有问题可以问他。","pinyin":"wǒ tóng xué zài zhè ge xué xiào gōng zuò hěn duō nián le， nǐ yǒu wèn tí kě yǐ wèn tā。","vi":"Bạn học của tôi đã làm việc ở trường này nhiều năm; nếu có câu hỏi, bạn có thể hỏi anh ấy.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99922,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-53","text":"★说话人的同学在哪儿上班？","zh":"说话人的同学在哪儿上班？","pinyin":"shuō huà rén de tóng xué zài nǎ ér shàng bān？","vi":"Bạn học của người nói làm việc ở đâu?","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.96395,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-57","text":"A饭店","zh":"饭店","pinyin":"fàn diàn","vi":"Quán cơm; nhà hàng","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99984,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-58","text":"B医院","zh":"医院","pinyin":"yī yuàn","vi":"Bệnh viện","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99993,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-59","text":"C学校","zh":"学校","pinyin":"xuéxiào","vi":"Trường học","translation":"edited","confidence":0.99872,"label":"C","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-62","text":"这个小朋友写字真好看。","zh":"这个小朋友写字真好看。","pinyin":"zhè ge xiǎo péng you xiě zì zhēn hǎo kàn。","vi":"Bạn nhỏ này viết chữ đẹp thật.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99835,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-64","text":"★那个小朋友：","zh":"那个小朋友：","pinyin":"nà ge xiǎo péng you：","vi":"Bạn nhỏ đó: …","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.97897,"role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-68","text":"A名字好听","zh":"名字好听","pinyin":"míng zi hǎo tīng","vi":"Tên nghe hay.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99901,"label":"A","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-69","text":"B写字好看","zh":"写字好看","pinyin":"xiě zì hǎo kàn","vi":"Viết chữ đẹp.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99871,"label":"B","role":"example"},{"id":"workbook-137-70","text":"C正在读书","zh":"正在读书","pinyin":"zhèng zài dú shū","vi":"Đang đọc sách.","translation":"edited","modelRevision":"opus-zh-vi-sentences-names-v2","confidence":0.99934,"label":"C","role":"example"}],"responseKey":"native-workbook-137-block-1"}],"audioTracks":[]}